  Keys  /keys                                                                            Esc returns
   Enter                 send                 Send a prompt, or a steering message during a turn
   Shift+Enter, Ctrl+J   line_break           Insert a line break
   Esc                   close_or_interrupt   Close what is on top; interrupt the turn when nothing
                                              is open
   Ctrl+C                clear_then_quit      Clear the draft, then quit
   ⌥0                    go_home              Go home
 › Ctrl+N                new_session          Start a new session
   ⌥1 ⌥2 ⌥3 ⌥4 ⌥5 ⌥6 ⌥7  rail_row_n           Switch to the session of rail card N
   ⌥8 ⌥9
   Delete, Backspace     delete_session       Delete the selected exited, or a live one with Delete
                                              session in the session list
   ⌥I                    interrupt_turn       Interrupt the turn on screen, whatever is open over
                                              it, except the /keys screen
⋮  ↑                     recall_prompt        Recall an earlier prompt from the project of the
⋮                                             session on screen
⋮  ←                     focus_rail           Move focus from an empty input box into the rail
   Ctrl+R                search_prompts       Search those prompts
   ⌥← ⌥→, Ctrl+← Ctrl+→, move_word            Move by word
   ⌥B ⌥F
   ⌥Backspace,           delete_word          Delete a word
 ⌥I is bound to Interrupt the turn on screen, whatever is open over it, except the /keys screen
